{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24485","headline":"酬梦得贫居咏怀见赠 · 白居易","name":"酬梦得贫居咏怀见赠","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"岁阴生计两蹉跎，相顾悠悠醉且歌。\n厨冷难留乌止屋，门闲可与雀张罗。\n病添庄舃吟声苦，贫欠韩康药债多。\n日望挥金贺新命，俸钱依旧又如何。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24485.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24485","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}